      ],
      "source": "https://atlanta.com/articles/misc/west-end-atlanta",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Neighbors created the Blocks of Culture around 2000 to brand West End and celebrate its historic identity.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
